async def direct() -> AsyncIterator[MyEvent]:
    yield MyEvent(type="a", content="b")

print(json.dumps(app.openapi(), indent=2))

print("#" * 80)
print("nested")
print("#" * 80)

app = FastAPI()
router = APIRouter()

@router.post("/nested", response_class=EventSourceResponse)
async def nested() -> AsyncIterator[MyEvent]:
    yield MyEvent(type="a", content="b")

app.include_router(router)

print(json.dumps(app.openapi(), indent=2))
```




When an SSE endpoint (`response_class=EventSourceResponse`) is defined on an `APIRouter`, and that router is included into a parent router via `include_router` (with or without a prefix), the `_EffectiveRouteContext`

